Select GPU runtime
Which GPU should Strata use? This sets the container's GPU passthrough; the engine itself is fetched for the detected card on first launch.
setup,create
param|STRATA_GPU
AMD (ROCm/HIP)|amd|/dev/kfd + /dev/dri: Radeon RX 7000/9000, R9700, Strix Halo (default)
NVIDIA (CUDA)|nvidia|CDI nvidia.com/gpu=all; needs the host's CDI spec
